---@field SecretArn aws.kendra.SecretArn The Amazon Resource Name (ARN) of a secret in Secrets Manager contains the key-value pairs required to connect to your Jira data source. The secret must contain a JSON structure with the following keys:
---@field UseChangeLog? aws.kendra.Boolean TRUE to use the Jira change log to determine which documents require updating in the index. Depending on the change log's size, it may take longer for Amazon Kendra to use the change log than to scan all of your documents in Jira.
